分析以下代码的输出：
```java
class Test {
  static int x = 1;
  int y = 2;

  void modify() {
    x++;
    y++;
  }

  public static void main(String[] args) {
    Test t1 = new Test();
    Test t2 = new Test();
    t1.modify();
    t2.modify();
    System.out.println(t1.y + " " + t2.y + " " + x);
  }
}```
